===Etymology===
From [[w:Henry Shrapnel|Henry Shrapnel]], British army officer who invented an exploding fragmentation shell.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A collective term for [[fragment]]s and [[debris]] thrown out by an [[exploding]] [[shell]] or [[landmine]].

